      "index": "baO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 619233629,
      "version": 292,
      "versionNonce": 1198950749,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1774316960306,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Gĉ = Grafo G complemento con 200 vértices tq xy ∈ E(Gĉ) <=> xy !∈ E(G) => χ(Gĉ) ≥ 29 ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Gĉ = Grafo G complemento con 200 vértices tq xy ∈ E(Gĉ) <=> xy !∈ E(G) => χ(Gĉ) ≥ 29 ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "OnrrAYbIOl0D9ldb9e4iF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4370.480375206882,
      "y": -680.483743113934,
      "width": 1129.300048828125,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "baP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 65877277,
      "version": 549,
      "versionNonce": 626272211,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1774318014906,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Como existe un coloreo propio en G de 7 colores, por definición\nde coloreo propio, en los lados xy ∈ E(G) => c(x) != c(y)\n\nEn caso de c(x) = c(y) => xy !∈ E(G) lo que implica xy ∈ E(Gĉ) ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Como existe un coloreo propio en G de 7 colores, por definición\nde coloreo propio, en los lados xy ∈ E(G) => c(x) != c(y)\n\nEn caso de c(x) = c(y) => xy !∈ E(G) lo que implica xy ∈ E(Gĉ) ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
